    "body": "https://codepen.io/tigt/post/separators-inside-the-select-element seems to have discovered this actually exists _today_ in Blink and WebKit; this seems to date from 2005 (https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/23dccecb771c5517a0c6a103daa7375793c7d372), though the parser side got broken at some point (probably with the HTML parser rewrite?), so currently it only works with DOM manipulation (and presumably XHTML? not tested).",
