    "body": "OK. I made a clearer demo: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/10554\r\n\r\nHere's how it looks on macOS in Chrome:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"270\" alt=\"The listbox has some spacing between the before options and the after options. The dropdown has a gray thin line between the before options and the after options.\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/184315133-3899c0aa-5bcf-41de-be68-5bd32586d433.png\">\r\n\r\nEdge 103 on Windows 11 (tested with BrowserStack) also supports it:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"270\" alt=\"The listbox has some spacing between the before options and the after options. The dropdown has a black thin line between the before options and the after options.\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/184315680-7631e1f8-b0dd-4f39-957b-8fd87b6477dc.png\">\r\n",
