    "updated_at": "2022-08-12T08:44:55Z",
    "body": "On iOS Safari it's not supported:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"332\" alt=\"Listbox select is a one-line widget which opens a popup to select options. No extra separator for the hr element.\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/184317164-a2730a01-8a12-4a9e-91b6-c6db5fd49087.png\"> <img width=\"332\" alt=\"Dropdown is not a full width popup but a dropdown anchored to the select widget. No extra separator for the hr element.\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/184317187-50b69361-4163-44c2-a8eb-279dbb1eeb84.png\">\r\n\r\nOn Chrome on Android the `hr` becomes its own selectable option!:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"332\" alt=\"Listbox select is a one-line widget that opens a popup to select options. There's a selectable option with no label between the before and after options.\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/184317830-a0b35a67-1f1a-4235-8631-1bc988265a40.png\"> <img width=\"332\" alt=\"Dropdown select also opens a popup to select options. There's a selectable option with no label between the before and after options.\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/184318260-f11bcc42-d3e6-42b8-9ac0-cd4f8d616199.png\">\r\n\r\n",
